Thank you to Alejandro Buján for Tendedero (https://github.com/alejandrobujan/tendedero).

Airer (晾衣绳) is an independent Windows port of Tendedero. It keeps the line
and its gestures, adapts them to Windows 10 and Windows 11, and adds
changeable hotkeys for a region snip and a full-screen shot. Those changes
are described in README.md.

The original source code is Copyright (c) 2026 Alejandro Buján and is licensed
under the MIT License below. That license does not grant any rights to the
Tendedero name or the Tendedero icon. This project is therefore named Airer
and ships with its own icon. It is not Tendedero and is not endorsed by
Alejandro Buján.

